WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.419 --> 00:00:04.086
(ominous music)

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:08.750
- Sami Thicket, huh?

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.923
That's quite a journey.

00:00:17.061 --> 00:00:18.120
- There you are.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.713
I was afraid you got lost.

00:00:20.731 --> 00:00:23.148
(soft music)

00:00:25.468 --> 00:00:26.769
(gasps)

00:00:26.769 --> 00:00:29.477
- I've read all about you.

00:00:29.477 --> 00:00:31.894
(soft music)

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.210
- Because the sanction are true chosen.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.390
- Let's have an adventure, Gurjin.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.060
It'll be great fun, Gurjin,

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:41.893
but it never is.

00:00:45.138 --> 00:00:47.138
- The bonds of sisterhood can be tested,

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:51.937
but never broken.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.380
- It's mother's fault.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:00.203
She spoils her, Brea's her favorite.

00:01:02.436 --> 00:01:04.790
(soft music)

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:06.283
- Honored lords,

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.817
welcome to Ha'rar.

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:13.043
- To the crystal.

00:01:17.099 --> 00:01:20.477
- But I see the chance
for a new beginning.

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:26.310
- May the dead become one with Thra again.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.540
May we feel their tears in rain.

00:01:31.663 --> 00:01:34.277
(soft music)

00:01:34.277 --> 00:01:37.227
- Here's the rest of the
materials you requested, Princess.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:42.750
- Is there a problem?

00:01:42.750 --> 00:01:44.083
- It's your son, Rian.

00:01:45.075 --> 00:01:45.908
- Oh.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.220
- Your return to Stone in the Wood

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.463
puts our clan in a dangerous position.

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.070
- If I come out of this crazy,

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:01.950
the last thing I'll do
before I lose my mind

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:02.850
is take your life.

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.587
- Perhaps we should all
take a deep calming breath.

00:02:15.763 --> 00:02:18.930
- Old friend, why make me walk so far?

00:02:22.583 --> 00:02:24.000
- We are eternal.

00:02:30.695 --> 00:02:32.528
- I will not fail you.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:37.810
- I deserve to be punished.

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:38.850
Flog me.

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:39.893
Scold me.

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.810
- We must make a bloody example

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.863
of this treacherous Gelfling.

00:02:49.971 --> 00:02:52.477
- Oh, why am I not surprised?

00:02:57.849 --> 00:03:00.349
- Guess we'll get the crystal.

00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:06.466
- Only the hunt matters.

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:12.770
- Oh it's wonderful to see you.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:13.814
Do you see my wonder?

00:03:13.814 --> 00:03:15.481
Look upon my wonder.

00:03:23.384 --> 00:03:24.940
- One.

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.043
Did the message find them?

00:03:34.972 --> 00:03:38.010
- You turned your eye away from Thra.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:38.860
What's the stars?

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.713
- Another world.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.833
Another time.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.983
Another age.

00:03:52.171 --> 00:03:53.883
- [Woman] Who catches the light?

00:03:56.051 --> 00:03:57.968
Splitting the darkness.

00:03:59.418 --> 00:04:01.335
Revealing your destiny.

00:04:06.590 --> 00:04:07.713
- [Deet] I don't think
anything will ever be

00:04:07.713 --> 00:04:09.160
like it was again.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.643
- [Rian] No, it will be better.

